# The coast's sward at one in the afternoon: heather in drifts on pale grass, from
# above at the play camera and wider, close on the heath, and over the shoulder
# (world.gdshader shore_sward, matter.gdshaderinc shore_cushion).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/coast-sward.tour --seed=1 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 13
place coast
await top_view 4
wait 2.0
shot 01-the-coast-from-above with land:coast
zoom 30
wait 1.5
shot 02-the-coast-from-higher with land:coast
zoom 15
near gorse
wait 1.5
zoom 7
wait 1.0
shot 03-close-on-the-heath with land:coast
zoom 15
wait 0.6
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
wait 1.0
shot 04-the-heath-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
release shoulder_peek
